        "reference": "Alma 49:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 49,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I said that the city of Ammonihah had been rebuilt. I say unto you, yea, that it was in part rebuilt; and because the Lamanites had destroyed it once because of the iniquity of the people, they supposed that it would again become an easy prey for them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "Alma 16:2 (2–3, 9, 11)."
